by0yWkRiUzJaSDhiWmR3T01RRWhtdE43LXJZZy1qN2hoczNxcnJERktKMUhFaXE0eDBRd25VaFRuWlpB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Verizon 與 AWS 簽署 20 億美元人工智慧協議"},{"title":"Can Verizon (NYSE:VZ) Deliver on Its Raised Guidance This Year?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOeUhkNWk3TjdUblNxcHctNWZqeEh2eUNYRFhDQVRLdUpIVXZOT2RxSlFNX1ZoVmN2b1k5a2lJSU9KSnFYNWRkc2cxa0htRzE3STA3Umo1SHc4X09JRHZOWUxLSGxiWVJtRk5nWFU4cVFNaFRPdjZMSGRxOWFGb0tuQWZEVEl5T1hramNmZ2xQVXJkNG1nYmFIN1l4Q1dQRHUyZmlDT1hn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"Verizon（NYSE：VZ）今年能否兌現其提高的指引？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/732712/000073271226000007/vz-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Verizon Communications Inc. (the Company) is a holding company that, acting through its subsidiaries (together with the Company, collectively, Verizon), is one of the world's leading providers of communications, technology, information and streaming products and services to consumers, businesses and government entities. With a presence around the world, we offer data, video and voice services and solutions on our networks and platforms that are designed to meet customers' demand for mobility, reliable network connectivity and security.","zh":"Verizon Communications Inc.（以下簡稱「本公司」）是一家控股公司，透過其子公司（與本公司統稱為 Verizon）行事，是向消費者、企業和政府實體提供通訊、技術、資訊和串流媒體產品及服務的全球領先提供者之一。我們的業務遍及世界各地，在我們的網路和平台上提供數據、視訊和語音服務及解決方案，旨在滿足客戶對行動性、可靠網路連線和安全性的需求。"},{"en":"We have two reportable segments that we operate and manage as strategic business units - Verizon Consumer Group (Consumer) and Verizon Business Group (Business).","zh":"我們有兩個作為策略業務部門運營和管理的可報告部門 - Verizon Consumer Group（消費者）和 Verizon Business Group（商業）。"},{"en":"Our Consumer segment provides consumer-focused wireless and wireline communications services and products. Our wireless services are provided across one of the most extensive wireless networks in the United States (U.S.) under the Verizon family of brands and through wholesale and other arrangements. As of the date this report is being filed, our wireline services are provided in 31 U.S. states and Washington D.C. over our 100% fiber-optic network through our fiber product portfolio, as well as over a traditional copper-based network. We also provide fixed wireless access (FWA) broadband through our fifth-generation (5G) or fourth-generation (4G) Long-Term Evolution (LTE) networks as an alternative to traditional landline internet access.","zh":"我們的消費者部門提供以消費者為中心的無線和有線通訊服務和產品。我們的無線服務透過美國 (U.S.) 最廣泛的無線網路之一以 Verizon 品牌系列並透過批發和其他安排提供。截至本報告提交之日，我們透過光纖產品組合透過 100% 光纖網路以及傳統的銅質網路在美國 31 個州和華盛頓特區提供有線服務。我們也透過第五代 (5G) 或第四代 (4G) 長期演進 (LTE) 網路提供固定無線存取 (FWA) 寬頻，作為傳統固定網路存取的替代方案。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Customers can obtain our wireless services on a postpaid or prepaid basis. Retail (non-wholesale) postpaid accounts primarily represent retail customers that are directly served and managed by Verizon and use Verizon branded services. A single account may include monthly wireless services for a variety of connected devices. Our postpaid service is generally billed one month in advance for a monthly access charge in return for access to and usage of network services. Our prepaid service is offered only to Consumer customers and enables individuals to obtain wireless services without credit verification by paying for all services in advance. As of December 31, 2025, we had 96 million postpaid connections and 20 million prepaid connections, representing approximately 83% and 17% of our Consumer wireless retail connections, respectively.","zh":"客戶可以透過後付費或預付費的方式獲得我們的無線服務。零售（非批發）後付費帳戶主要代表由 Verizon 直接服務和管理並使用 Verizon 品牌服務的零售客戶。單一帳戶可以包括各種連接設備的每月無線服務。我們的後付費服務通常會提前一個月收取每月的接取費，以換取存取和使用網路服務的費用。我們的預付費服務僅向消費者客戶提供，使個人能夠透過提前支付所有服務費用而無需信用驗證即可獲得無線服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有 9,600 萬個後付費連接和 2,000 萬個預付費連接，分別約占我們消費者無線零售連接的 83% 和 17%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Verizon Consumer Group","val":106807000000,"zh":"Verizon 消費者集團部門"},{"name":"Verizon Business Group","val":29069000000,"zh":"Verizon 業務集團部門"}],"total":138191000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service & Other","val":112721000000,"zh":"服務及其他"},{"name":"Wireless Service","val":83703000000,"zh":"無線服務"},{"name":"Fios Revenues","val":12922000000,"zh":"菲奧斯收入"}],"total":138191000000}},"peers":["T","PG","KO","JPM","JNJ"]}}